<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title><span class="notranslate brand-protected" translate="no">Natural 100%</span></title>



<div id="nat100-embed">
<header class="topbar">
<div class="container">
<div class="nav glass">
<a class="brand" href="https://frutex-ks.com/natural-100#nat100-hero">
<span class="brand-text">
<strong><span class="notranslate brand-protected" translate="no">Natural 100%</span></strong>
<span>From the heart of fruits</span>
</span>
</a>
<nav aria-label="Natural 100 navigation" class="menu">
<a href="https://frutex-ks.com/natural-100#nat100-story">About</a>
<a href="https://frutex-ks.com/natural-100#nat100-tastes">Tastes</a>
<a href="https://frutex-ks.com/natural-100#nat100-benefits">Benefits</a>
<a href="https://frutex-ks.com/natural-100#nat100-ingredients">Ingredients</a>
</nav>
</div>
</div>
</header>
<main>
<section class="hero section" id="nat100-hero">
<div class="container">
<div class="hero-grid">
<div class="hero-copy glass reveal is-visible">
<span class="eyebrow"><span class="notranslate brand-protected" translate="no">Natural 100%</span></span>
<h1>From the heart of fruits.</h1>
<p>A premium fruit drink concept built around freshness, careful sourcing, and a cleaner everyday choice. <span class="notranslate brand-protected" translate="no">Natural 100%</span> is presented as a wholesome range made to feel vivid, modern, and naturally full of life.</p>
<div class="hero-actions">
<a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://frutex-ks.com/natural-100#nat100-tastes">Explore the range</a>
<a class="btn btn-secondary" href="https://frutex-ks.com/natural-100#nat100-partner">Become our partner</a>
</div>
</div>
<div class="hero-visual reveal is-visible">
<div class="hero-fruit-bg"></div>
<div class="floating-card glass one">
<strong>Natural fruit energy</strong>
Fresh taste, bright color, clean visual identity.
</div>
<div class="floating-card glass two">
<strong>0% added sugar</strong>
Crafted to let the fruit profile lead the experience.
</div>
<div class="floating-card glass three">
<strong>Vitamins inside</strong>
Positioned around feel-good daily benefits.
</div>
<img decoding="async" alt="Natural apple bottle" class="hero-bottle lazy entered loaded" src="./apple_files/Natural-Apple-750ml.webp" data-src="https://frutex-ks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Natural-Apple-750ml.webp" data-ll-status="loaded">
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="nat100-story">
<div class="container">
<div class="story-grid">
<div class="story-media glass reveal is-visible">
<img class="lazy entered loaded" decoding="async" alt="Natural sourcherry bottles" src="./apple_files/01.-Sourcherry.jpg.webp" data-src="https://goldeneagle-ks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/01.-Sourcherry.jpg.webp" data-ll-status="loaded">
</div>
<div class="story-copy glass reveal is-visible">
<span class="eyebrow">About Natural</span>
<h2>From our land to your family.</h2>
<p><span class="notranslate brand-protected" translate="no">Natural 100%</span> is presented as a drink line connected to fruit cultivation, careful sourcing, and a journey that starts at the plantations and continues to the final product experience.</p>
<p>This redesign keeps that natural core, but translates it into a more modern, minimalist, premium landing page that feels cleaner and more intentional.</p>
<p>The positioning stays simple: vibrant fruit taste, a healthier profile, and a family-friendly product identity rooted in freshness.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

